<%--
_Sys_Companion_Detail - one companion, in three columns: its facts, verbs and state document;
its live console (<Companion_Output>, stdout / stderr / both); its recent instances and
endpoint traffic. The body of the companion dialog (_Sys_Companion_Detail.open(name)).

$name - the companion (required)

The shell never re-renders - the console keeps its scrollback - and each column follows the
companion on its own: _Sys_Companion_Facts and _Sys_Companion_Activity on
Companion_Changed_Topic, Companion_Output on Companion_Output_Topic.
--%>
<Define:_Sys_Companion_Detail tag="div">
    <div class="_Sys_Companion_Detail__facts">
        <_Sys_Companion_Facts $sid="facts" $name=this.args.name />
    </div>
    <div class="_Sys_Companion_Detail__output">
        <div class="_Sys_Companion_Detail__heading">Console</div>
        <Companion_Output class="_Sys_Companion_Detail__console" $companion=this.args.name />
    </div>
    <div class="_Sys_Companion_Detail__activity">
        <_Sys_Companion_Activity $name=this.args.name />
    </div>
</Define:_Sys_Companion_Detail>
